  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "專題討論",
    "sub_ename": "SEMINAR",
    "describe_ch": "完成大學學位的畢業選項之一。它提供學生反思所了解的研究經驗，並探討理論如何和研究相關。修課學生將有能力制定計劃，並通過有效輔導和邊做邊學的活動執行相關研究計畫。學生將以5-10人分為一小組，由一位老師引導和帶領來完成一個翻譯項目、教學計劃、論文研究或教學活動以作為學習的結果。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is a graduation option leading students to finish their BA studies.  It provides students with an opportunity for reflecting on what they have learned about research experiences and investigating how theory and research are related.  Students will develop the ability to plan and implement projects effectively through mentored and learning-by-doing activities.  Supposedly students will be divided into 5–to-10-member groups mentored and guided by a teacher to finish either a translation project, a teaching plan, a research paper, or a teaching activity as the result of the learning.",
